<title>AUSTRALIA: SOCCER-FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Four-Nation</p>
<p>soccer tournament at Lang Park on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Australia	    2  South Korea	    1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Matthew Bingley 37, Alistair Edwards 72</p>
<p>South Korea - Ha Seok Ju 76</p>
<p> Norway		 3  New Zealand	    0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers - Bent Skammerlsrud 60, Chris Zoricich</p>
<p>79 own goal, Havard Flo 84</p>
